@baseUrl = http://localhost:5083

### Reject a blank title (expect 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "test"
}


### Update task 1s
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy groceries and milk",
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Check the saved task
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/6


### Delete task 1 — expect 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/1


### Get 
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/

